    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Property Shop are delighted to present 2 Murtagh Road, a charming and well-presented home ideally situated in this popular and convenient location.\r\nThis lovely property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and has been thoughtfully maintained, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a comfortable city home. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright living/dining room, kitchen, utility room and modern shower room at ground floor level. Upstairs, there are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, offering excellent bedroom accommodation.\r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private west-facing patio yard, providing an outdoor space and an ideal spot to enjoy the afternoon and evening sun. \r\nThe location is a real highlight, with a host of local amenities and services within easy reach. The surrounding area offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities, while Dublin city centre and neighbouring areas are easily accessible by a choice of public transport options.\r\n2 Murtagh Road represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a comfortable two-bedroom home in a well-established and highly convenient Dublin location. Early viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this fine property has to offer. Viewings are by appointment only through our Manor Street office.\r\n\r\nHallway 2.7m (8'10\") x 1.1m (3'7\")\r\nSpacious hallway with tiled floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen 2.8m (9'2\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\r\nLocated to the front of the property, with fitted units, integrated appliances, tiled surround & tiled floor. Opens into the living area.\r\n\r\nLounge 3.4m (11'2\") x 4m (13'1\")\r\nA spacious living area with wooden floors, stove with tiled surround, room to dine.\r\n\r\nUtility 2m (6'7\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with tiled floor, plumbed for laundry, access to the rear yard.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.3m (7'7\") x 1.6m (5'3\")\r\nFully tiled shower room with WC, WHB with vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 2.8m (9'2\") x 4m (13'1\")\r\nBright double bedroom to the front with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 3.4m (11'2\") x 3m (9'10\")\r\nA second double bedroom to the rear.\r\n\r\nExterior 4.6m (15'1\") x 2m (6'7\")\r\nA West facing patio to the rear, on street disc parking to the front.\r\n\r\nArea \r\nApprox.  60 Sq Mts 643 Sq Ft"
      },
